<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8695" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνθάπτομαι</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντ-</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lay hold of in return,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ Πέρσαι . . ἅπτοντο αὐτοῦ: . . οἱ
					δὲ ἀντάπτοντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.137
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hec.</u>
				275
			</span></i>: but mostly, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			simply, <i>lay hold of, grapple with, engage in,</i> c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τοῦ πολέμου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.138
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τῶν πραγμάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					8.97
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τῆς λογιστικῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					525c
				</span></i>
			: generally, <i>reach, attain,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τερμόνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Med.</u>
					1182
				</span></i>
			 (dub.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>lay hold of, seize, attack,</i> esp. of pain, grief, etc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλευμόνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					778
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				474
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρενῶν, καρδίας,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Med.</u>
				55
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				1360
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ τῆς μισθοφορᾶς . .
				μαλακωτέρως ἀνθήπτετο</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τισσαφέρνους</span>) <i>attacked</i> him, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				8.50
			</span></i> (unless abs., 'was less firm in his
		<i>counter-grip</i>').</div>
